            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "NtFtLn",
              "name": "divider",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1,
              "fill": "#FFAA3330"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NtFtTx",
              "name": "noteContent",
              "fill": "#CCAA77",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Features Page v5 — 产品逻辑对齐修正\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n【❗ 产品逻辑审计: 基于 OpenClaw GitHub 仓库】\n来源: github.com/openclaw/openclaw (176k stars, MIT)\n\n【关键事实】\n• OpenClaw = 个人 AI 助手软件 (开源免费)\n• AgentPuter = 托管 OpenClaw 的基础设施\n• 类比: Vercel 之于 Next.js = AgentPuter 之于 OpenClaw\n\n【v4 → v5 修正的不吐合】\n\n① Telegram 不是 AgentPuter 的功能\n   ✘ v4: “Telegram built-in” — 像是我们做的\n   ✓ v5: OpenClaw 原生支持 15+ 渠道\n   ✓ AgentPuter 的价值 = 让这些渠道 24/7 运行\n   OpenClaw 支持: WhatsApp, Telegram, Slack, Discord,\n   Google Chat, Signal, iMessage, Teams, WebChat,\n   Matrix, Zalo, Zalo Personal\n\n② 'Auth Proxy' 概念不存在\n   ✘ v4: “Auth Proxy: credentials never exposed”\n   ✓ 实际: OpenClaw 用 DM Pairing Policy\n   ✓ 实际: 模型 API key 存在 openclaw.json 配置中\n   ✓ AgentPuter 可以做: Web UI 管理配置, 不需要 SSH\n\n③ Multi-Agent 已经存在\n   ✘ v4: “Multi-agent: ✓ Planned”\n   ✓ 实际: OpenClaw 已有 sessions_list/send/history\n   ✓ 实际: 支持多 agent 路由 (per-channel)\n   ✓ AgentPuter 可以做: 多 Pod 管理 + 跨Pod通信\n\n④ Skills 是核心生态, 不能忽略\n   ✘ v4: 完全没提 Skills\n   ✓ 实际: 50+ 内置 skills (github, notion, 1password...)\n   ✓ 实际: 565+ 社区 skills (ClawHub)\n   ✓ 实际: mcporter skill 桥接 MCP 服务器\n   ✓ AgentPuter 可以做: Skill 预装 + 一键安装\n\n⑤ “3 Commands” 流程需要重新定义\n   ✘ v4: agentputer create / connect telegram / deploy\n   ✓ 实际流程应该是:\n     agentputer create my-agent\n       → Pod启动, OpenClaw预装完成\n     agentputer channels add telegram\n       → Web UI 输入 BotFather token\n       → 或 CLI: agentputer config set telegram.botToken=xxx\n     agentputer status\n       → ✓ OpenClaw gateway running\n       → ✓ Telegram connected\n       → ✓ 3 skills active\n\n⑥ OpenClaw 安全模型 (真实)\n   • DM Pairing: 陌生人收到配对码才能对话\n   • Sandbox Mode: Docker容器隔离非主会话\n   • Elevated Bash: 按会话切换提权\n   • `openclaw doctor`: 安全诊断工具\n   • AgentPuter 可以做: Pod级别隔离 + 预配置安全策略\n\n【重新定义 AgentPuter 的价值层】\n① Managed Hosting: Pod + OpenClaw 预装 + 自动更新\n② Web Dashboard: 状态/日志/Token/渠道 一目了然\n③ Channel Config UI: 点击添加渠道, 不用编辑JSON\n④ Skill Management: 预装常用skills + ClawHub一键安装\n⑤ Cost Control: 模型 API 费用监控 + 预算限制\n⑥ Security Defaults: 预配置 DM Pairing + Sandbox\n⑦ Zero DevOps: 不需要 Docker/nginx/systemd/SSL",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
