            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NtBlTx",
              "name": "noteContent",
              "fill": "#CCAA77",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Blog Page — 核心价值与逻辑需求\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n【核心价值】\n内容营销引擎 + SEO长尾流量入口 + 建立行业权威。\n用「AI Agent基础设施」领域的思想领导力吸引目标用户。\n\n【页面逻辑】\n① Hero → // BLOG 标签 + 主题描述\n② 标签过滤器 → All / Product / Engineering / Vision / Tutorial\n③ 置顶文章 → 大卡片，左图右文，突出核心文章\n④ 文章网格 → 3列卡片，缩略图+标签+日期+标题+摘要\n⑤ Load More → 分页加载\n\n【内容策略】\n• Vision类 → 行业趋势/未来预判 → 吸引思考者\n• Engineering类 → 架构深度/技术实现 → 吸引开发者\n• Tutorial类 → 实操指南 → 吸引新用户\n• Product类 → 产品更新/路线图 → 留住现有用户\n\n【SEO目标】\n• 长尾关键词: 'AI agent hosting' / '24/7 AI agent' / 'deploy AI agent cloud'\n• 每篇文章目标: 月搜索流量 > 500\n\n【MVP文章列表(7篇)】\n1. Your Agent Needs Its Own Computer (Vision) ← 核心文章\n2. OpenClaw Architecture: How It Works (Engineering)\n3. Deploy Your First AI Agent in 2 Minutes (Tutorial)\n4. AgentPuter MVP 1.0: What We Built (Product)\n5. The 3 Signals That Software Is Changing (Vision)\n6. Why We Chose Hetzner Over AWS (Product)\n7. Connecting Telegram to Your Agent (Tutorial)",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
