            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "NtTgLn",
              "name": "divider",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 1,
              "fill": "#FFAA3330"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NtTgTx",
              "name": "noteContent",
              "fill": "#CCAA77",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Add Channel Page v3 — 统一渠道配置体验\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n【核心修正】\n• 从 'Telegram Setup' 改为 'Add Channel'\n• 增加渠道选择器 (Telegram/WebChat/WhatsApp/Slack/Discord)\n• Step 3 明确标注 DM Pairing 是 OpenClaw 的安全机制\n• 成功状态明确说明 OpenClaw 处理 AI\n\n【页面逻辑】\n① 面包屑: AgentPuter / Dashboard / Pod / Add Channel\n② 渠道选择器: Telegram(高亮) / WebChat / WhatsApp(gray)...\n③ 根据选择显示不同的配置步骤:\n\n   Telegram:\n     Step 1: @BotFather 创建 bot → 获取 token\n     Step 2: 粘贴 token 到 Dashboard\n     Step 3: DM Pairing 验证 (发消息 → 收配对码 → 批准)\n\n   WebChat:\n     自动激活, 无需配置\n     通过 Dashboard 直接访问\n\n   WhatsApp (1.1+):\n     扫码配对 (Baileys)\n     需要常开手机获取初始连接\n\n   Slack (1.1+):\n     输入 SLACK_BOT_TOKEN + SLACK_APP_TOKEN\n\n   Discord (1.1+):\n     输入 DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN\n\n【DM Pairing 说明】\n这是 OpenClaw 的核心安全机制:\n• dmPolicy='pairing': 陌生人收到一个省略码\n• 用户必须在 Dashboard 或 CLI 批准\n• 批准后加入 allowlist\n• 可以设置 dmPolicy='open' 开放所有人\n• `openclaw doctor` 可检查安全配置\n\n【与 Docs 页的关系】\n• Docs → 'Add Channels' 显示渠道列表 + 配置概览\n• Dashboard → 'Add Channel' 显示实际配置 UI (TgPg1)\n• 两者内容一致, 但入口不同:\n  Docs = 教学引导 (tutorial)\n  Dashboard = 实际操作 (action)",
              "lineHeight": 1.7,
              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
